  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.09,
      "end_seconds": 8.56,
      "duration_seconds": 7.47,
      "text": "Hello doctor, um, sorry, I took a wrong turn on the way here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.59,
      "end_seconds": 14.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.49,
      "end_seconds": 27.04,
      "duration_seconds": 6.55,
      "text": "I wanted to get tingling in my thumb and first two fingers looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.16,
      "end_seconds": 38.87,
      "duration_seconds": 10.71,
      "text": "tell me a bit more about it: how bad it it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.58,
      "end_seconds": 54.85,
      "duration_seconds": 15.27,
      "text": "it comes and goes. It's moderate, honestly. Oh, and dropping things. That's been about the same, nearly five years. I did have numbness in my fingers at one point, but that's gone now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.74,
      "end_seconds": 64.04,
      "duration_seconds": 7.3,
      "text": "let me check a few things. Any neck pain, injury to the wrist or swelling of the wrist?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.64,
      "end_seconds": 67.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "No, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.94,
      "end_seconds": 73.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "Have you noticed weight loss or weakness in the legs?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.42,
      "end_seconds": 82.05,
      "duration_seconds": 7.63,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, no, no weight loss or weakness in the legs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.03,
      "end_seconds": 86.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "On the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.41,
      "end_seconds": 88.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.85,
      "end_seconds": 92.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.21,
      "end_seconds": 112.87,
      "duration_seconds": 19.66,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago. I've never touched a cigarette. I grab fast food at lunch most days. I live with my elderly mother. I look after my grandchildren most days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.31,
      "end_seconds": 120.36,
      "duration_seconds": 6.05,
      "text": "Okay, has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.01,
      "end_seconds": 124.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "No, nothing as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.89,
      "end_seconds": 144.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.59,
      "end_seconds": 149.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "I've got an underactive thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.24,
      "end_seconds": 152.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "Yes, carry on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.16,
      "end_seconds": 156.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Diabetes, for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.29,
      "end_seconds": 161.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.04,
      "end_seconds": 164.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "my father had bowel cancer"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.16,
      "end_seconds": 168.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.78,
      "end_seconds": 175.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "it's Eltroxin, 100 micrograms, every morning for my thyroid"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.33,
      "end_seconds": 179.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Any surgery in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.24,
      "end_seconds": 187.23,
      "duration_seconds": 5.99,
      "text": "I had a mole taken off my arm a few years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.6,
      "end_seconds": 208.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.02,
      "end_seconds": 219.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "okay, this won't take long.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.32,
      "end_seconds": 249.73,
      "duration_seconds": 12.41,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 17, BMI works out to 32.0. And BP is 108 over 77, pulse is 64 beats a minute, weight 72 kilos, height 150 centimetres."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.94,
      "end_seconds": 256.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "I'd like to check you over now, if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.97,
      "end_seconds": 259.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.35,
      "end_seconds": 275.28,
      "duration_seconds": 7.93,
      "text": "Tapping over the wrist brings on the tingling, and the muscle at the base of the thumb looks slightly thin"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.82,
      "end_seconds": 282.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.91,
      "end_seconds": 326.39,
      "duration_seconds": 30.48,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, this is probably carpal tunnel syndrome. I'd like to arrange nerve conduction tests for hand numbness. Let's get blood tests, for numbness. A wrist splint at night will often settle it. I'd like you to see occupational therapy as well, and I'll write the referral. I'll want another look after the nerve test. Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 326.93,
      "end_seconds": 330.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "no, that's all thanks a lot"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.81,
      "end_seconds": 333.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "look after yourself"
    }
  ]
}